OL,3,GNEWSAMPs call for police inquiry into
OL,4,Adistrict council
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo MPs have called for police to
OL,7,Finvestigate "significant concerns"
OL,8,Fabout Ashfield District Council.
OL,10,FIn a letter to Nottinghamshire Police
OL,11,FChief Constable Steve Cooper,
OL,12,FAshfield's Reform UK MP Lee Anderson
OL,13,Fand Labour's Michelle Welsh, whose
OL,14,FSherwood Forest seat includes part of
OL,15,Fthe authority's area, said a number of
OL,16,F"deeply concerning" issues had emerged
OL,17,Ffollowing the fraud conviction of
OL,18,Fformer leader Jason Zadrozny.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
