OL,3,GNEWSAMPs call for police inquiry into
OL,4,Adistrict council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said the issues "relate
OL,7,Fparticularly" to the council's planning
OL,8,Fdepartment, as well as the council's
OL,9,Fprocurement processes.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for the council said it
OL,12,Fensured "decisions are lawful and
OL,13,Fproperly governed". Nottinghamshire
OL,14,FPolice has been contacted for comment.
